FUNTBL,	ACPDIR		/
	ACPR08				/ READ PHYSICAL FUNCTION 8BIT.
	ACPW08				/ WRITE PHYSICAL FUNCTION 8BIT.
	ACREAD				/ READ LOGICAL.
	ACWRIT				/ WRITE LOGICAL.
